# Go2W 真机导航显示；由本机 RViz 显式加载。
# PlannerSupportMap 显示规划器累计支撑；CurrentSupport 显示地形模块当前结果。
# 历史支撑和原始配准地图默认关闭，避免历史残影和额外绘制压力。
Panels:
- Class: rviz_common/Displays
  Help Height: 78
  Name: Displays
  Property Tree Widget:
    Expanded:
    - /Global Options1
    - /Status1
    Splitter Ratio: 0.5
  Tree Height: 549
- Class: rviz_common/Tool Properties
  Expanded:
  - /Nav2 Goal1
  Name: Tool Properties
  Splitter Ratio: 0.5886790156364441
- Class: rviz_common/Views
  Expanded:
  - /Current View1
  Name: Views
  Splitter Ratio: 0.5
- Class: nav2_rviz_plugins/Navigation 2
  Name: Navigation 2
